chapter.v:
Reuben, the 


firstborn of, 


Israel; the sons of Reuben: of Hanoch, the clan of the Hanochites; of Pallu, the clan of the Palluites;

The sons 


of Simeon, 


according to their clans: of Nemuel, the clan of the Nemuelites; of Jamin, the clan of the Jaminites; of Jachin, the clan of the Jachinites;

The sons 


of Gad, 


according to their clans: of Zephon, the clan of the Zephonites; of Haggi, the clan of the Haggites; of Shuni, the clan of the Shunites;

of Ozni, 


the clan, 


of the Oznites; of Eri, the clan of the Erites;

The sons 


of Issachar, 


according to their clans: of Tola, the clan of the Tolaites; of Puvah, the clan of the Punites;

These are 


the sons, 


of Gilead: of Iezer, the clan of the Iezerites; of Helek, the clan of the Helekites;

and of 


Asriel, the, 


clan of the Asrielites; and of Shechem, the clan of the Shechemites;

The sons 


of Benjamin, 


according to their clans: of Bela, the clan of the Belaites; of Ashbel, the clan of the Ashbelites; of Ahiram, the clan of the Ahiramites;

The sons 


of Naphtali, 


according to their clans: of Jahzeel, the clan of the Jahzeelites; of Guni, the clan of the Gunites;
